00:25:54.060 --> 00:25:55.860
and an epigenetic piece to that.

538
00:25:55.860 --> 00:25:58.350
Well, the generational trauma is the genocide

539
00:25:58.350 --> 00:26:02.250
and oppression and loss of lands and livelihood,

540
00:26:02.250 --> 00:26:04.470
and the deprivation of culture,

541
00:26:04.470 --> 00:26:07.920
the deliberate destruction of spiritual ways.

542
00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:10.383
All this happened in Canada and in the US.

543
00:26:11.790 --> 00:26:15.510
In Canada, Native children were abducted from their homes

544
00:26:15.510 --> 00:26:16.860
for 100 years

545
00:26:16.860 --> 00:26:20.430
and forced to go into these residential schools

546
00:26:20.430 --> 00:26:22.140
