00:27:12.870 --> 00:27:14.370
And I could talk about that,

568
00:27:14.370 --> 00:27:17.010
but because how they raise children

569
00:27:17.010 --> 00:27:18.993
was how we evolved as human beings.

570
00:27:21.480 --> 00:27:25.230
We're meant to raise children by evolution.

571
00:27:25.230 --> 00:27:26.780
So, we destroyed that for them.

572
00:27:27.930 --> 00:27:30.240
And now we wonder why do they have more alcoholism?

573
00:27:30.240 --> 00:27:31.680
Why do they have more addiction?

574
00:27:31.680 --> 00:27:33.300
Why do they have more illness?

575
00:27:33.300 --> 00:27:34.920
Why do they have more violence?

576
00:27:34.920 --> 00:27:39.750
It's because we've robbed them of their nature.

577
00:27:39.750 --> 00:27:42.600
And so, when I talk about a toxic society,

578
00:27:42.600 --> 00:27:45.960
I'm talking about a society in which what is normal

