00:28:16.110 --> 00:28:18.300
20% of Canadians have high blood pressure.

589
00:28:18.300 --> 00:28:20.910
30% of Europeans have hypertension.

590
00:28:20.910 --> 00:28:22.873
I mean, it just goes on and on and on, right?

591
00:28:22.873 --> 00:28:23.706
Yeah.

592
00:28:23.706 --> 00:28:25.260
So, nobody's immune from this

593
00:28:25.260 --> 00:28:27.840
and something is terribly awry.

594
00:28:27.840 --> 00:28:30.600
Like, we are completely out of balance.

595
00:28:30.600 --> 00:28:31.863
We're out of balance.

596
00:28:32.910 --> 00:28:33.760
Here's the thing.

597
00:28:34.620 --> 00:28:36.120
We're out of balance.

598
00:28:36.120 --> 00:28:40.530
Now, that imbalance affects some people more than others,

599
00:28:40.530 --> 00:28:42.063
but it does affect everybody.

600
00:28:43.831 --> 00:28:48.033
There's no stratum of society that escapes the stresses.

