00:31:01.590 --> 00:31:04.860
And that be accepted by the parents.

653
00:31:04.860 --> 00:31:06.157
Well, we tell parents,

654
00:31:06.157 --> 00:31:09.057
"No, your children's anger is not acceptable."

655
00:31:09.990 --> 00:31:12.060
So, children get the message that they're not acceptable.

656
00:31:12.060 --> 00:31:13.830
You have to work to be acceptable.

657
00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:16.680
You have to suppress yourself to be acceptable.

658
00:31:16.680 --> 00:31:20.880
And children need free play out there in nature.

659
00:31:20.880 --> 00:31:24.750
Free play, not with gadgets, not with cell phones,

660
00:31:24.750 --> 00:31:27.810
not with games on the internet, but free play in nature.

661
00:31:27.810 --> 00:31:30.090
This is our essential needs of human beings.

662
00:31:30.090 --> 00:31:33.240
That goes into the four, they are really six.

