00:31:33.240 --> 00:31:36.363
This six A's that you talk about in the book, right?

664
00:31:37.470 --> 00:31:41.400
The agency would be the ability to roam and be outdoors

665
00:31:41.400 --> 00:31:45.059
and attachment being important as well.

666
00:31:45.059 --> 00:31:47.067
Well, attachment is, well--

667
00:31:47.910 --> 00:31:50.880
Authenticity, agency, go ahead.

668
00:31:50.880 --> 00:31:52.023
Anger.
Anger.

669
00:31:53.940 --> 00:31:55.563
Acceptance.
Autonomy.

670
00:32:00.482 --> 00:32:01.530
These are the healing pathways.

671
00:32:01.530 --> 00:32:03.810
What I'm saying is, for people to heal,

672
00:32:03.810 --> 00:32:06.450
they have to find their own agency, they have to.

673
00:32:06.450 --> 00:32:09.240
Whatever happens to them, they need to participate

674
00:32:09.240 --> 00:32:11.130
in the decisions that affect their lives,

675
00:32:11.130 --> 00:32:12.830
particularly the health decisions.

676
00:32:15.894 --> 00:32:17.070
And it's very interesting.

