00:32:45.390 --> 00:32:49.560
He studied people, just as I have, who got better

687
00:32:49.560 --> 00:32:52.170
despite giving terminal diagnosis

688
00:32:52.170 --> 00:32:54.270
after the failure of medical treatment

689
00:32:54.270 --> 00:32:57.003
or even if they refused medical treatment.

690
00:32:58.290 --> 00:33:01.740
Dr. Kelly Turner is an oncological psychologist

691
00:33:01.740 --> 00:33:04.006
who worked with cancer patients.

692
00:33:04.006 --> 00:33:05.700
And she also did a study

693
00:33:05.700 --> 00:33:10.470
of people who got spontaneously better, "spontaneously."

694
00:33:10.470 --> 00:33:11.970
But when I talk to these people,

695
00:33:11.970 --> 00:33:14.880
when Kelly Turner or Jeff Redigar talks to these people,

696
00:33:14.880 --> 00:33:17.100
there's nothing spontaneous about their healing.

697
00:33:17.100 --> 00:33:18.480
They all did something.

698
00:33:18.480 --> 00:33:20.310
And the biggest thing they did

699
00:33:20.310 --> 00:33:23.670
is they developed a different relationship to themselves.

700
00:33:23.670 --> 00:33:25.605
They became authentically themselves.

701
00:33:25.605 --> 00:33:27.510
They stopped pleasing people.

702
00:33:27.510 --> 00:33:29.310
They actually consulted what they needed

703
00:33:29.310 --> 00:33:31.031
and wanted within themselves.

704
00:33:31.031 --> 00:33:34.290
Now, I'm not saying that this is a magic cure all,

705
00:33:34.290 --> 00:33:36.740
but I'm saying that the people that do get better

706
00:33:37.650 --> 00:33:39.990
on their own with or without medical treatment

707
00:33:39.990 --> 00:33:41.760
in the face of terminal diagnosis,

708
00:33:41.760 --> 00:33:44.610
they're the ones who took agency over their lives.

709
00:33:44.610 --> 00:33:46.650
And in our medical system,

710
00:33:46.650 --> 00:33:49.177
people are made to be very passive recipients.

711
00:33:49.177 --> 00:33:51.720
"You are the experts, do to me what you need to do."

712
00:33:51.720 --> 00:33:53.430
So, agency is very, very important.

713
00:33:53.430 --> 00:33:55.083
Healthy anger is very important.

714
00:33:55.920 --> 00:33:57.213
Healthy anger is,

715
00:33:58.200 --> 00:34:01.320
well, I began chapter two, I think,

716
00:34:01.320 --> 00:34:05.310
with the case of a woman who's given a diagnosis

